---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
		<Header />
		<main class="flex-1">
			<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-24 md:px-6 md:py-32">
				<h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
					Hello, Fellow Developer!
				</h1>
				<div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
					<p>
						Welcome to my obnoxious and weird blogs
					</p>
					<p>
						If you find anything of use to you here or even remotely helpful 
						consider me honored. Please excuse my blog writing skills as well. If my thoughts and 
						blog flow seems all over the place that is cause I am a scatter brain and that is 
						literally how I think.
					</p>
					<p>
						Aside from that let me address the elephant in the room. Yes this blog has ads. I know 
						it is a bit weird but hosting this and buying domains cost money and I am just trying to recover 
						some of those costs. This self-hosting thing maybe a hobby but it is an expensive one for sure 
						I can tell you that.
					</p>
					<p>Anyways aside from all that have fun and Happy Coding !</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
